	<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Notch reads your calendars to show upcoming events. Nothing leaves your Mac.</string>
	<key>NSHumanReadableCopyright</key>
	<string>Free and open source under GPL-3.0</string>
	<key>NSLocationUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Notch uses your approximate location for the weather widget. It's rounded to about 1 km.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Notch uses your approximate location for the weather widget. It's rounded to about 1 km.</string>
